.venv/
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# ANCHORED WITH A LEADING SLASH, and that slash is load-bearing. Written as `data/` these
# rules match a directory of that name at ANY depth, so `data/` also matched src/rbp/data/
# and `results/` would match any nested results dir. git stopped tracking the rbp.data
# package, `gcloud builds submit` honours .gitignore, so the image was built without it and
# its own test step failed with ModuleNotFoundError: No module named 'rbp.data'.
# /data/* not /data/ -- git cannot re-include anything inside a directory that is itself
# excluded, so `!/data/evidence/` below is silently ignored unless the exclusion names the
# CONTENTS. This is the same class as the `/results/` mistake below and cost ten minutes to
# spot, because `git status` simply shows nothing rather than complaining.
/data/*
# The published numbers and the evidence for them ARE the artifact, so they ship. `/results/`
# was ignored wholesale, which meant `git ls-files results` returned 0: a cloner saw no
# tables, no figures, and could not check one of the 86 golden assertions in a repo whose
# entire pitch is that verification is a stage.
#
# data/evidence/ is the per-example model scores (1120 files, 35 MB). It is under /data/,
# which is ignored, so it needs an explicit un-ignore. It is what makes every deep-model AUROC
# recomputable offline -- verified: 95/95 datasets reproduce the published SpliceBERT and CNN
# numbers to 3.33e-16 and 2.22e-16. Without it the whole evidence base lives only in a GCS
# bucket whose billing credit expires 2026-11-18.
/results/*
!/results/tables/
!/results/figures/
!/data/evidence/
/logs/
/.preflight-ok
/.preflight-modal-ok
cloud/terraform/.terraform/
cloud/terraform/terraform.tfstate*
cloud/terraform/terraform.tfvars
cloud/terraform/tfplan*
cloud/jobs/rendered/

# LaTeX build artefacts. paper.pdf IS tracked, because it is the deliverable a reader wants
# without installing TeX; the intermediates are regenerated by manuscript/build.sh.
manuscript/*.aux
manuscript/*.log
manuscript/*.out
manuscript/*.bbl
manuscript/*.blg
manuscript/*.synctex.gz
